Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.20,H_fil,,0,0,0,,Unang mainit na higaan sa frozen world... nag-giyera ang buong barangay
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.20,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.16,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Susmaryosep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.10,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Master Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.24,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Para kang diyos na nagbabadya sa lupa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:04.36,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko inimagine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.84,S_fil,,0,0,0,,na matutulog ka sa dipan ng putik
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:07.08,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ay ganito ka init.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:09.00,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Isang gabi ng init — ang buto-buto ko, gumaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:10.56,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hindi na tayo takot sa lamig, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:11.52,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sa itim na uling na 'to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:12.76,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at sa heated bed na 'to,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.70,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ang taglamig natin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:14.64,S_fil,,0,0,0,,sigurado na.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.04,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ako ang unang nakakita!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:17.80,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Winasak ko 'yan sa yelo nang isa-isa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:18.84,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bakit sa'yo pa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.20,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kalokohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:22.50,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Magalang ka sa matatanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:24.02,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Gamit na ganito kaganda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:26.22,S_fil,,0,0,0,,dapat sa mga matatanda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:27.90,S_fil,,0,0,0,,para makaligtas sa taglamig.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,'Yan ang tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:30.42,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Gurang ka na!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:31.38,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Binubuwag mo ang BUHAY ko!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.32,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Isauli mo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:33.38,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kapal mo akong sampalin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.03,0:00:36.03,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kayamanan lahat 'yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.07,0:00:36.97,S_fil,,0,0,0,,KAYAMANAN lahat 'yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:38.31,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bakit sa isang tao lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:39.25,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Maghati-hati tayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:40.19,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ihati na 'yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:43.32,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bitaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:44.20,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sa akin 'yan!
